{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 1677 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D12"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cefazolin sodium has been on FDA's shortage list since 2018-11-30 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 876911 at Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. (FEI 3002807173) ended 2014-03-28 and was classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 1677 days before the shortage was first posted on 2018-11-30.",
      "cites": ["D12", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections at the plant in 2015-06-19, 2016-04-12, 2020-03-06, 2023-02-03, and 2023-04-21 were all classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our 2 g/50 mL supply (NDC 00264310511) is labeled as manufactured by B. Braun Medical Inc. at a B BRAUN plant.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 53 units of 2 g/50 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East's days on hand from 8.9 to 13 while Corvale General retains 17 days.",
      "cites": ["D15", "D4", "D5"]
    }
  ]
}
